<chapter xml:id="ch-triangles-theorems" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Triangles and Theorems</title>

  <introduction>
    <p>
      Triangles are the simplest polygon, yet they underpin much of geometry and trigonometry.
      This chapter covers triangle properties, Pythagoras' theorem, and circle theorems.
    </p>
  </introduction>

